WEBVTT

00:00:01.049 --> 00:00:04.348
A Sun Fairy who
makes warm sunshine...

00:00:04.452 --> 00:00:07.285
A Wind Fairy who
makes soft wind blow...

00:00:07.389 --> 00:00:10.790
And a Snow Fairy who
makes sparkly snow fall...

00:00:10.892 --> 00:00:15.556
If fairies like these suddenly
showed up, what would you do?

00:00:15.664 --> 00:00:17.632
Huh? Let me see.

00:00:17.632 --> 00:00:20.567
They would probably be hungry,
so I'd give them waffos to eat.

00:00:20.669 --> 00:00:24.730
Then I would take them home and feed
them Grandma Regina's special stew.

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:28.298
-Um, and then...
-You're talking about you, Sugar.

00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:30.935
Huh? Oh, yeah.

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:35.650
Sugar Baby Love

00:00:35.650 --> 00:00:38.653
On my lips

00:00:38.653 --> 00:00:44.023
The rouge of tears

00:01:03.178 --> 00:01:06.882
Sugar Baby Love

00:01:06.882 --> 00:01:14.186
I don't want to know
such a thing as love.

00:01:17.726 --> 00:01:21.093
Sugar Baby Love

00:01:21.263 --> 00:01:24.299
On my lips,

00:01:24.299 --> 00:01:27.735
The rouge of tears.

00:01:32.107 --> 00:01:35.710
On Thursdays

00:01:35.710 --> 00:01:38.680
I buy roses and...

00:01:38.680 --> 00:01:42.912
add a letter.

00:01:46.721 --> 00:01:50.292
Sugar Baby Love

00:01:50.292 --> 00:01:53.094
When I see you
in my dreams,

00:01:53.094 --> 00:01:58.122
you're so caring.

00:02:23.825 --> 00:02:25.816
Oh, well.
Let's go.

00:02:35.470 --> 00:02:37.233
Until next time...

00:02:47.148 --> 00:02:48.581
I'm home!

00:02:49.250 --> 00:02:50.018
-Hello, dear.

00:02:50.018 --> 00:02:51.152
-Hello, dear.
-I'm home.

00:02:51.152 --> 00:02:52.744
-Oh, Saga?
-Waffo!

00:02:54.322 --> 00:02:55.590
-Hello!

00:02:55.590 --> 00:02:56.784
-Hello!
-I'm home!

00:03:10.238 --> 00:03:12.331
Um, who is this girl?

00:03:12.440 --> 00:03:14.340
How would I know?

00:03:14.442 --> 00:03:16.740
Don't you remember, Saga?

00:03:16.845 --> 00:03:17.777
Huh?

00:03:18.246 --> 00:03:19.838
About Miranda.

00:03:19.948 --> 00:03:23.748
Isn't she your
friend's older sister?

00:03:24.719 --> 00:03:27.244
She came over
once with a baby.

00:03:27.789 --> 00:03:29.657
So, this girl is...

00:03:29.657 --> 00:03:31.192
This is Kanon.

00:03:31.192 --> 00:03:33.626
How old are you, Kanon?

00:03:33.728 --> 00:03:37.899
Well, I'm one, two, three.

00:03:37.899 --> 00:03:39.594
I'm three!

00:03:40.201 --> 00:03:43.637
Oh, is that all?
She's way smaller than me.

00:03:44.406 --> 00:03:46.340
Wow, you're smart.

00:03:46.775 --> 00:03:49.044
-That's why I can even sleep over.

00:03:49.044 --> 00:03:50.445
-That's why I can even sleep over.
-Sleep over?

00:03:50.445 --> 00:03:54.582
Miranda says she has to go out
of town for work for a while.

00:03:54.582 --> 00:03:58.153
So, Kanon will be staying
with us for a few days.

00:03:58.153 --> 00:03:59.677
Oh, I see.

00:04:03.691 --> 00:04:06.327
Oh! Would you
like more juice?

00:04:06.327 --> 00:04:08.063
Awe, my juice!

00:04:08.063 --> 00:04:10.793
-Help yourself, Kanon.
-I was gonna drink that!

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:12.989
Yeah!

00:04:13.802 --> 00:04:14.700
Thank you!

00:04:15.603 --> 00:04:16.592
Umm...

00:04:17.272 --> 00:04:19.974
I'm Saga. Pleased
to meet you, Kanon.

00:04:19.974 --> 00:04:22.568
Yeah! Big Sister Saga!

00:04:25.447 --> 00:04:28.007
By the way,
I'm "Big Sister" to you, too!

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:34.622
Look!
Look, Big Sister Saga!!

00:04:34.622 --> 00:04:37.716
This is how you play
dance at kindergarten.

00:04:39.494 --> 00:04:42.330
I-I see.
You're good at that.

00:04:42.330 --> 00:04:44.699
But while we're eating,
you have to sit down.

00:04:44.699 --> 00:04:47.635
I'll teach you how to do it,
too, Big Sister Saga.

00:04:47.635 --> 00:04:49.500
First, you do this.

00:04:51.840 --> 00:04:53.675
Next, you do this.

00:04:53.675 --> 00:04:55.973
First, you do this.

00:04:56.111 --> 00:04:58.306
Next, you do this.

00:05:02.784 --> 00:05:05.053
-No! I hate shampoo!

00:05:05.053 --> 00:05:06.054
-No! I hate shampoo!
-Hey.

00:05:06.054 --> 00:05:08.045
I know how you feel.

00:05:08.523 --> 00:05:12.093
Hey, don't move.
You have to get clean.

00:05:12.093 --> 00:05:14.084
I don't have to get clean!

00:05:21.803 --> 00:05:23.338
You'll catch a cold.

00:05:23.338 --> 00:05:25.966
Yeesh! Come on.
Dry your hair.

00:05:27.909 --> 00:05:28.977
-Hold it!

00:05:28.977 --> 00:05:30.311
-Hold it!
-Yucky!

00:05:30.311 --> 00:05:31.980
Put on your undies!

00:05:31.980 --> 00:05:34.642
No, they're backwards!
Your front's on the back!

00:05:34.749 --> 00:05:36.683
That tickles!

00:05:37.018 --> 00:05:39.287
Anyway, get dressed.
I'm begging you!

00:05:39.287 --> 00:05:41.778
-No way!
-Wait, Kanon!

00:05:42.757 --> 00:05:44.359
This is me.

00:05:44.359 --> 00:05:48.455
This is Grandma Regina.
And this is Big Sister Saga...

00:05:51.499 --> 00:05:55.697
Get it together, Saga.
You're the older sister!

00:05:56.771 --> 00:05:58.966
Awe, let me rest a little.

00:06:00.441 --> 00:06:03.410
Oh, all right.
I'll look after her.

00:06:04.279 --> 00:06:07.840
What could you be drawing?
Maybe it's a fabulous work of art.

00:06:07.949 --> 00:06:09.177
All done!

00:06:10.852 --> 00:06:13.844
Hey, that's dangerous!
What if you squashed me?

00:06:16.324 --> 00:06:17.518
-No!
-No!

00:06:19.594 --> 00:06:22.620
Airplane! Airplane! Yay!

00:06:33.308 --> 00:06:35.674
Wow. You're a big
sister now, Saga?

00:06:36.778 --> 00:06:38.646
It just might suit you.

00:06:38.646 --> 00:06:40.548
You're wrong about that.

00:06:40.548 --> 00:06:43.312
She always clings to me.
It really throws me off.

00:06:44.419 --> 00:06:45.687
Hey, she's cute.

00:06:45.687 --> 00:06:48.189
Aren't you glad you
have a little sister?

00:06:48.189 --> 00:06:48.985
Yeah.

00:06:49.324 --> 00:06:50.814
I wonder...

00:06:52.060 --> 00:06:54.662
Oh, my. She tried to
get the Magic Flower?

00:06:54.662 --> 00:06:58.566
My, my. That was quite a disaster.

00:06:58.566 --> 00:07:02.570
It's true! Just a little more,
and she would have picked it!

00:07:02.570 --> 00:07:05.006
First of all,
you have no patience,

00:07:05.006 --> 00:07:07.634
fussing over one little child.

00:07:07.742 --> 00:07:08.731
Huh?

00:07:10.345 --> 00:07:12.480
Big Sister Saga!
Listen! Listen!

00:07:12.480 --> 00:07:14.249
The pigeons are
good eaters.

00:07:14.249 --> 00:07:16.274
They ate it all!

00:07:16.384 --> 00:07:18.419
And, you know what?

00:07:18.419 --> 00:07:21.322
Awe, look how dirty
your hands are.

00:07:21.322 --> 00:07:22.846
Oh, my. Miss Saga.

00:07:23.891 --> 00:07:25.119
Greta?

00:07:25.860 --> 00:07:28.263
What do you think
of my hairstyle?

00:07:28.263 --> 00:07:31.824
I had it done by the finest
hair and make-up artist.

00:07:31.866 --> 00:07:36.098
Oh, well. My hair is good to begin with,
so any hair style suits me.

00:07:39.073 --> 00:07:40.563
Wow!

00:07:41.542 --> 00:07:43.611
Your hair is amazing!

00:07:43.611 --> 00:07:47.582
Oh, my. I don't know whose child
this is, but she's definitely a girl.

00:07:47.582 --> 00:07:50.244
She's fascinated
by true beauty.

00:07:50.852 --> 00:07:54.344
Her hair is funny.
It looks like cotton candy!

00:07:57.325 --> 00:07:58.293
Cotton?

00:07:58.293 --> 00:08:00.386
I'll fix it for you.

00:08:03.231 --> 00:08:05.300
Yeah! This is better.

00:08:05.300 --> 00:08:07.835
Uh, well, we have
to be somewhere,

00:08:07.835 --> 00:08:09.325
so excuse us!

00:08:09.704 --> 00:08:11.296
Wait, Saga!

00:08:18.279 --> 00:08:20.948
Yeesh! You don't know
the meaning of fear.

00:08:20.948 --> 00:08:22.779
Hey, where are
we going next?

00:08:29.590 --> 00:08:30.716
Saga!

00:08:31.559 --> 00:08:35.096
It looks like you can play
it today. The manager is out.

00:08:35.096 --> 00:08:36.085
Oh...

00:08:43.971 --> 00:08:45.336
Still...

00:08:53.514 --> 00:08:55.450
Wow!
It's huge!

00:08:55.450 --> 00:08:59.409
Listen! Listen! My mommy also
loves pianos, and you know what?

00:08:59.854 --> 00:09:02.322
You promised to
be quiet, remember?

00:09:45.933 --> 00:09:47.268
Bam-bam! Bam-bam!

00:09:47.268 --> 00:09:48.703
Stop the racket!

00:09:48.703 --> 00:09:50.772
This hurts, doesn't it?

00:09:50.772 --> 00:09:53.206
I can't hear Saga play!

00:09:56.043 --> 00:09:57.032
Stop!

00:09:57.812 --> 00:10:02.306
You can't treat the piano so roughly!
You promised to be quiet, remember!

00:10:04.118 --> 00:10:06.780
But you were
having all the fun.

00:10:08.423 --> 00:10:11.292
L-Listen.
Don't cry, Kanon.

00:10:11.292 --> 00:10:14.284
Come on. Be a good girl,
Kanon. Ok? Ok?

00:10:16.197 --> 00:10:17.265
-I'm home!

00:10:17.265 --> 00:10:18.755
-I'm home!
-I'm home!

00:10:21.969 --> 00:10:25.769
Was I a handful for my mom
when I was this little, too?

00:10:27.608 --> 00:10:29.405
You may have been...

00:10:29.811 --> 00:10:31.005
What?

00:10:31.879 --> 00:10:35.349
But I wasn't as
bad as her, was I?

00:10:35.349 --> 00:10:37.485
I wasn't, right!

00:10:37.485 --> 00:10:41.046
You and Kanon might be
more alike than you think.

00:10:43.491 --> 00:10:45.721
I said "No"!!

00:10:45.827 --> 00:10:48.596
Kanon! Let's have snack time!

00:10:48.596 --> 00:10:50.086
Coming!

00:10:52.266 --> 00:10:56.225
I won't let you touch
the Magic Flower.

00:11:00.875 --> 00:11:02.710
You aren't going
to sleep, Sugar?

00:11:02.710 --> 00:11:07.340
Yeah! I have to protect the Magic
Flower from the hands of Kanon!

00:11:15.957 --> 00:11:18.425
We're not alike, right?

00:11:26.901 --> 00:11:29.233
I'll protect it,
no matter what.

00:11:52.660 --> 00:11:56.460
Wow, those are some bags under
your eyes. Did you study too hard?

00:11:57.265 --> 00:11:58.199
-It's Kanon.

00:11:58.199 --> 00:11:59.564
-It's Kanon.
-Little Kanon?

00:12:00.434 --> 00:12:05.394
I had to keep fixing her
blanket until morning.

00:12:05.506 --> 00:12:08.109
If I had known what a
bad sleeper she was,

00:12:08.109 --> 00:12:10.411
I wouldn't have slept with her.

00:12:10.411 --> 00:12:13.180
Wow. I guess it's
tough being a big sister.

00:12:13.180 --> 00:12:17.742
Oh, well. For now, forget about your
cute little sister and let's have lunch.

00:12:18.452 --> 00:12:20.545
Hey, Miss Saga?

00:12:21.355 --> 00:12:26.657
I think it was rude of you
to ignore me all morning.

00:12:26.761 --> 00:12:29.664
Or maybe you've been rendered
speechless by my hairstyle,

00:12:29.664 --> 00:12:32.531
which is new and improved,
even since yesterday?

00:12:34.435 --> 00:12:38.531
Lunch, huh? I wonder if
Kanon has had lunch already...

00:12:39.340 --> 00:12:39.740
I wonder if she's behaving herself.
I hope she's taking her afternoon nap.

00:12:39.740 --> 00:12:42.209
I wonder if she's behaving herself.
I hope she's taking her afternoon nap.
Hey, are you listening?

00:12:42.209 --> 00:12:44.769
I wonder if she's behaving herself.
I hope she's taking her afternoon nap.
See my hair?
It's gorgeous. Gorgeous!

00:12:45.446 --> 00:12:47.471
Rather than a big sister...

00:12:47.848 --> 00:12:50.248
I think that Saga...

00:12:51.018 --> 00:12:53.054
-She's more like a mother...
-She's more like a mother...

00:12:53.054 --> 00:12:56.046
But she seems to
be a picky eater...

00:13:13.140 --> 00:13:16.803
I did it. The Magic Flower
bloomed. Waffo!

00:13:18.479 --> 00:13:20.879
I bet I can play this.

00:13:23.751 --> 00:13:25.616
You have to be quiet!

00:13:36.097 --> 00:13:39.089
I can do it outside, right?
There are birds there, too.

00:13:42.036 --> 00:13:43.526
Alley-oop!

00:13:50.411 --> 00:13:52.179
I wonder if Kanon
is still napping...

00:13:52.179 --> 00:13:55.148
She's throwing off my schedule again.
I can't play the piano today, either.

00:13:56.450 --> 00:13:58.111
Hey, Saga!

00:13:59.987 --> 00:14:01.088
-It's horrible!

00:14:01.088 --> 00:14:02.783
-It's horrible!
-What's wrong?

00:14:03.457 --> 00:14:04.725
-It's Sugar and that girl!

00:14:04.725 --> 00:14:05.783
-It's Sugar and that girl!
-That girl?

00:14:10.998 --> 00:14:12.590
Kanon, don't move!

00:14:15.169 --> 00:14:16.500
Kanon!

00:14:16.737 --> 00:14:18.728
How did this happen?

00:14:18.839 --> 00:14:21.809
I bet she tried to
pick the Magic Flower!

00:14:21.809 --> 00:14:22.707
Huh?

00:14:22.810 --> 00:14:24.334
See? Sugar is up there.

00:14:28.015 --> 00:14:30.575
Yeesh! Why is she so heavy?

00:14:41.295 --> 00:14:44.287
Come on, over here!
Reach out and grab my hand!

00:14:44.465 --> 00:14:46.194
Her hand? But if she does that...

00:14:50.504 --> 00:14:51.706
Th-That would be...

00:14:51.706 --> 00:14:52.840
I can't!

00:14:52.840 --> 00:14:56.776
I can't! This piano is important
to Big Sister Saga!!

00:14:58.012 --> 00:15:00.014
That's why I can't!

00:15:00.014 --> 00:15:01.208
Kanon.

00:15:18.499 --> 00:15:20.330
-Thank goodness!
-Thank goodness!
Kanon!

00:15:21.936 --> 00:15:24.138
Are you ok?
Does it hurt anywhere?

00:15:24.138 --> 00:15:26.107
We're all ok.

00:15:26.107 --> 00:15:29.873
The Magic Flower, me,
and Kanon are all ok.

00:15:34.081 --> 00:15:37.073
Kanon? Did you get hurt?

00:15:48.429 --> 00:15:51.489
Mommy!
It was scary!

00:15:52.533 --> 00:15:55.798
It's all right now.
There, there...

00:16:20.561 --> 00:16:22.051
Saga!

00:16:23.130 --> 00:16:26.998
Saga! Are you all right?
Does it hurt anywhere?

00:16:27.802 --> 00:16:29.270
Mommy?

00:16:29.270 --> 00:16:31.305
You made me worry!

00:16:31.305 --> 00:16:34.741
But I wanted to
play the piano.

00:16:42.416 --> 00:16:43.974
There, there...

00:17:02.970 --> 00:17:07.007
I'm glad that the Magic Flower
and Kanon are both ok.

00:17:07.007 --> 00:17:10.311
She gives Season Fairies
a lot of trouble.

00:17:10.311 --> 00:17:11.579
Tell me about it.

00:17:11.579 --> 00:17:14.343
What does she think
the Magic Flower is?

00:17:24.758 --> 00:17:27.158
Don't make me worry
too much, ok?

00:17:28.562 --> 00:17:29.494
Smooch.

00:17:32.733 --> 00:17:37.404
I guess I gave my mom
a lot of trouble, too.

00:17:37.404 --> 00:17:38.894
Maybe.

00:17:41.075 --> 00:17:42.576
But, you know...

00:17:42.576 --> 00:17:47.348
Your mother was rewarded more
than enough for her trouble.

00:17:47.348 --> 00:17:49.441
Surely by you...

00:17:50.217 --> 00:17:51.844
Big Sister Saga.

00:17:51.952 --> 00:17:52.941
Kanon.

00:17:53.721 --> 00:17:55.416
Are you ok now?

00:17:55.489 --> 00:17:57.424
L-Listen.

00:17:57.424 --> 00:17:59.153
Um, I...

00:18:00.928 --> 00:18:03.226
I... Big Sister's piano!

00:18:03.397 --> 00:18:05.524
I'm really sorry!

00:18:07.601 --> 00:18:09.068
It's ok now.

00:18:09.236 --> 00:18:11.105
-Really?
-Uh-huh.

00:18:11.105 --> 00:18:16.270
Listen. I need to ask
Big Sister Saga a favor.

00:18:17.211 --> 00:18:18.701
Who, me?

00:18:24.251 --> 00:18:26.151
Thank you for looking after her.

00:18:27.254 --> 00:18:30.951
I've imposed upon
both you and Saga.

00:18:31.258 --> 00:18:34.395
Besides, she really
caused a commotion.

00:18:34.395 --> 00:18:36.330
Not at all!

00:18:36.330 --> 00:18:40.100
We're just glad that
Kanon didn't get hurt.

00:18:40.100 --> 00:18:42.193
Um, so where is Kanon?

00:19:04.658 --> 00:19:05.955
Kanon?

00:19:06.927 --> 00:19:10.898
She learned it from Saga
so she could play for you.

00:19:10.898 --> 00:19:12.263
What?

00:19:16.070 --> 00:19:17.765
She did?

00:19:20.007 --> 00:19:23.711
She said she wanted to play it for
her mother who loves the piano,

00:19:23.711 --> 00:19:28.774
but is always too busy with work.
She practiced it very diligently.

00:19:34.254 --> 00:19:35.744
Kanon.

00:20:16.463 --> 00:20:18.795
You did it, Kanon. Smooch!

00:20:19.400 --> 00:20:21.095
Kanon.

00:20:24.471 --> 00:20:26.302
Thank you, Kanon.

00:20:30.644 --> 00:20:32.980
Come again whenever you want.

00:20:32.980 --> 00:20:34.607
Well, we'll be going.

00:20:34.848 --> 00:20:35.916
-Bye-bye, Kanon.

00:20:35.916 --> 00:20:36.974
-Bye-bye, Kanon.
-Bye-bye!

00:20:37.518 --> 00:20:39.509
Bye-bye!

00:20:41.121 --> 00:20:42.322
-Oh!

00:20:42.322 --> 00:20:43.186
-Oh!
-Kanon?

00:20:46.326 --> 00:20:47.588
What is it?

00:20:48.796 --> 00:20:51.094
I love you, Saga Mommy!

00:20:53.367 --> 00:20:54.561
Bye-bye!

00:20:56.503 --> 00:20:58.338
She called you "mommy."

00:20:58.338 --> 00:21:01.241
You get all the
attention, Saga.

00:21:01.241 --> 00:21:03.004
What are you talking about?

00:21:08.449 --> 00:21:10.417
I hope she comes again.

00:21:11.018 --> 00:21:11.985
Why?

00:21:12.119 --> 00:21:15.213
Because this time,
I think we can be friends.

00:21:15.689 --> 00:21:18.659
Ok, then. You'll both have to
have a friendly shampoo together.

00:21:18.659 --> 00:21:20.251
That's different!

00:21:21.562 --> 00:21:23.655
You are like a mother, Saga.

00:21:35.042 --> 00:21:39.172
Thank you, Saga.
This is the greatest gift.

00:21:39.880 --> 00:21:40.869
Yeah!

00:21:45.285 --> 00:21:50.416
Your mother was rewarded more
than enough for her trouble.

00:22:00.767 --> 00:22:04.760
Surely by you...

00:22:21.121 --> 00:22:24.682
Wishes upon the Moon

00:22:25.492 --> 00:22:29.029
Melting in the water...

00:22:29.029 --> 00:22:34.468
I found a street
lined with trees.

00:22:34.468 --> 00:22:38.336
Songs of stardust...

00:22:39.206 --> 00:22:47.681
The breeze crossing over
the Bridge of Rainbows

00:22:47.681 --> 00:22:52.986
You already knew...

00:22:52.986 --> 00:22:57.446
The happiness of
connecting our hearts...

00:22:57.958 --> 00:23:00.127
Sugar Snow

00:23:00.127 --> 00:23:07.935
When powdery
snow whirls in town,

00:23:07.935 --> 00:23:13.340
The season of flower
blossoms is near,

00:23:13.340 --> 00:23:17.902
And, I think of you.

00:23:19.613 --> 00:23:26.620
The love that melts
our hearts and

00:23:26.620 --> 00:23:35.426
The dreams are
in your heart...

00:23:39.833 --> 00:23:40.734
Preview of the Next Episode

00:23:40.734 --> 00:23:44.738
Preview of the Next Episode
After watching you look
after Kanon, I understood

00:23:44.738 --> 00:23:46.940
that it's hard to
be a mother.

00:23:46.940 --> 00:23:49.676
Yeah. I'm sure your mother
has an especially hard time.

00:23:49.676 --> 00:23:53.680
She must be an incredible mother to
take care of such a crazy, selfish kid.

00:23:53.680 --> 00:23:55.315
Yeah! I think so, too!

00:23:55.315 --> 00:23:57.517
You're not supposed to agree!

00:23:57.517 --> 00:24:02.089
"A Little Snow Fairy Sugar"
The Next Episode Is
"The Faraway Town's First Snow"

00:24:02.089 --> 00:24:06.549
Waffo!! I'm going on a trip!
Saga, what would you like for a souvenir?
